WEBVTT

00:10.950 --> 00:15.915
<i>Well, here I am floating
face-down in a swimming pool.</i>
<i>好吧，我漂浮在这里
在游泳池里脸朝下。</i>

00:15.915 --> 00:21.156
<i>I always wanted a pool,
and in the end, I got one.</i>
<i>我一直想要一个游泳池，
最后，我得到了一个。</i>

00:21.156 --> 00:22.674
<i>How did I get here?</i>
<i>我是怎么到这里的？</i>

00:22.674 --> 00:26.846
<i>Well,
it all started yesterday.</i>
<i>嗯，
这一切都从昨天开始。</i>

00:32.398 --> 00:34.122
Ah.
啊。

00:34.122 --> 00:36.225
Oh!
哦！

00:44.743 --> 00:46.329
Sponge--
ugh!
海绵--
呃！

00:46.329 --> 00:48.260
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

00:48.260 --> 00:50.294
Whoa!
哇！

00:50.294 --> 00:53.156
Squidward,
did you say something?
章鱼哥，
你说了什么吗？

00:56.087 --> 00:58.225
Why are you digging up
your yard?
你为什么要挖
你的院子？

00:58.225 --> 01:00.225
I'm putting in a pool.
我正在把它放在一个水池里。

01:00.225 --> 01:02.812
Oh, a pool?
哦，游泳池？

01:04.777 --> 01:08.812
Mm-hmm, and I'm going
to invite my favorite
嗯嗯，我这就去
邀请我最喜欢的

01:08.812 --> 01:11.743
next-door neighbor
as soon as it's ready.
隔壁邻居
一旦准备好。

01:11.743 --> 01:12.846
Get off me!
放开我！

01:12.846 --> 01:14.536
I wouldn't be caught dead
我不会被抓死

01:14.536 --> 01:17.846
in your muddy, little
bacteria hole.
在你的泥泞中，小
细菌孔。

01:17.846 --> 01:21.777
I only swim
in sophisticated pools.
我只会游泳
在复杂的水池中。

01:21.777 --> 01:24.674
Well, if you change
your mind, it's almost done.
好吧，如果你改变
你的心意，快完成了。

01:24.674 --> 01:28.191
Yeah, sure.
是的，当然。

01:28.191 --> 01:29.950
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

01:29.950 --> 01:32.605
It's done!
完成了！

01:32.605 --> 01:33.777
Huh?
啊？

01:36.398 --> 01:39.501
What the--?
什么——？

01:39.501 --> 01:44.122
Why, it's beautiful.
为什么，它很漂亮。

01:45.329 --> 01:47.501
Why does he get to have a pool?
他为什么要拥有一个游泳池？

01:47.501 --> 01:49.915
If anyone around here
deserves a pool,
如果这附近有人
值得拥有一个泳池，

01:49.915 --> 01:51.329
it's me.
这就是我。

01:51.329 --> 01:54.294
Cannonball!
炮弹！

01:54.294 --> 01:55.881
Oh.
哦。

02:01.881 --> 02:05.467
Hey, Squidward,
come join us in the pool!
嘿，章鱼哥，
快来加入我们的泳池吧！

02:05.467 --> 02:08.156
Quick,
while the water's still wet!
快点，
趁水还是湿的！

02:09.950 --> 02:12.950
Pool!
水池！

02:15.363 --> 02:17.363
Forget the pool.
Forget the pool.
忘记游泳池吧。
忘记游泳池吧。

02:17.363 --> 02:19.708
Forget the pool.
忘记游泳池吧。

02:19.708 --> 02:21.570
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

02:21.570 --> 02:24.191
What the--?
pool.
什么——？
水池。

02:26.639 --> 02:28.363
Oh!
哦！

02:28.363 --> 02:29.950
Pool!
水池！

02:31.329 --> 02:35.191
Keep quiet,
you chlorinated clods!
保持安静，
你们这群氯化土块！

02:35.191 --> 02:37.156
- Cannonball!
- Huh?
- 炮弹！
- 啊？

02:37.156 --> 02:38.467
- Oh!
- Uh-oh.
- 哦！
- 呃哦。

02:41.984 --> 02:43.398
Ouch!
哎哟!

02:43.398 --> 02:45.570
Ow, ow.
噢，噢。

02:45.570 --> 02:47.812
Who needs a soggy, old pool
谁需要一个又湿又旧的泳池

02:47.812 --> 02:50.294
when you have the luxury
and elegance
当你有奢侈的时候
和优雅

02:50.294 --> 02:53.984
of indoor air conditioning. Mwah.
的室内空调。哇。

02:55.329 --> 02:58.225
Ooh, it's a little hot.
哦，有点热。

02:59.777 --> 03:00.812
Huh?
啊？

03:05.536 --> 03:09.087
That is one cool pool,
my fool.
那是一个凉爽的泳池，
我的傻瓜。

03:09.087 --> 03:12.950
See you tomorrow, SpongeBob.
- Swim safely, Patrick.
明天见，海绵宝宝。
- 安全游泳，帕特里克。

03:12.950 --> 03:15.053
Meet you at the pool.
在泳池遇见你。

03:18.605 --> 03:21.570
Oh, it's so hot.
噢，太热了。

03:21.570 --> 03:24.639
<i>Hey, Squidward...</i>
<i>嘿，章鱼哥……</i>

03:24.639 --> 03:27.018
What?
Who said that?
什么？
谁说的？

03:30.674 --> 03:34.467
Don't be a drip.
Take a dip.
别当滴滴。
泡一泡。

03:34.467 --> 03:37.570
You know you want to.
你知道你想要。

03:40.191 --> 03:42.708
SpongeBob is asleep.
海绵宝宝睡着了。

03:42.708 --> 03:46.674
I'll just take a quick dip
to cool off.
我会快速浸泡一下
冷静下来。

03:46.674 --> 03:49.639
That a boy!
那是个男孩！

03:49.639 --> 03:53.087
Jump in.
跳进去。

03:55.260 --> 03:57.881
Pool.
水池。

03:59.363 --> 04:01.950
Oh! Oh!
哦！哦！

04:09.639 --> 04:12.191
Thank Neptune
nobody heard me.
评分此翻译： 感谢你的评分 不好 好
没有人听到我说话。

04:12.191 --> 04:13.294
Ah!
啊!

04:14.536 --> 04:16.915
Gary, you leave
加里，你离开吧

04:16.915 --> 04:19.260
those sea bunnies alone
and come to bed.
那些海兔独自一人
然后上床睡觉。

04:19.260 --> 04:21.570
Ow!
噢！

04:28.605 --> 04:30.501
Phew.
唷。

04:30.501 --> 04:34.294
Now I can have the pool
all to myself.
现在我可以拥有泳池了
全部归我自己。

04:37.260 --> 04:41.398
Oh, pool.
哦，泳池。

04:48.950 --> 04:50.777
Ciao, everybody.
再见，大家。

04:50.777 --> 04:53.363
all: Ciao, Squidwardo.
全体：再见，章鱼哥。

04:53.363 --> 04:57.087
Squidwardo, you must play
your clarinet for us.
章鱼哥，你一定要玩
你的单簧管给我们。

04:57.087 --> 04:58.536
You simply must.
你必须这么做。

04:58.536 --> 05:00.984
I'll think about it.
我会考虑一下。

05:04.053 --> 05:05.950
all: Aw.
全体：噢。

05:23.674 --> 05:27.225
<i>Ciao bella.</i>
<i>再见贝拉。</i>

05:30.708 --> 05:32.708
- Mwah.
- Mwah.
- 哇。
- 哇。

05:34.536 --> 05:36.087
Wha--
世界卫生大会 -

05:38.743 --> 05:41.708
Egad, I must've fallen asleep.
哎呀，我一定是睡着了。

05:43.915 --> 05:46.467
I can't let them
find me here.
我不能让他们
在这里找到我。

05:48.708 --> 05:51.363
Ooh, I can't wait
to get wet!
哦，我等不及了
弄湿！

05:51.363 --> 05:53.191
<i>Hey, where's the pool toys?</i>
<i>嘿，泳池玩具在哪里？</i>

05:53.191 --> 05:55.191
Oh, not the pool shed,
not the pool shed,
哦，不是泳池棚，
不是泳池棚，

05:55.191 --> 05:56.501
not the pool shed.
不是泳池棚。

05:56.501 --> 05:58.018
<i>They're in
the pool shed, silly.</i>
<i>他们在
泳池棚，愚蠢。</i>

05:58.018 --> 05:59.398
Gotta hide.
Gotta hide.
得躲起来。
得躲起来。

05:59.398 --> 06:00.915
Gotta hide.
得躲起来。

06:00.915 --> 06:02.743
- Toys, toys, toys!
- Me first! Me first!
- 玩具，玩具，玩具！
- 我先！我先！

06:02.743 --> 06:04.432
Okay, Patrick.
好吧，帕特里克。

06:04.432 --> 06:06.846
You can pick first.
- Hmm.
你可以先选。
- 唔。

06:06.846 --> 06:10.570
Which toy,
which toy, which toy?
哪个玩具，
哪个玩具，哪个玩具？

06:10.570 --> 06:12.708
<i>Not me. Not me.
Not me.</i>
<i>不是我。不是我。
不是我。</i>

06:12.708 --> 06:15.122
I'll take this
big, ugly one.
我会接受这个
又大又丑的一个。

06:18.053 --> 06:21.570
It's too floppy to float on.
It needs more air.
它太软了，无法漂浮。
它需要更多的空气。

06:36.605 --> 06:38.260
Well, that ought to do it.
嗯，应该可以了。

06:38.260 --> 06:40.605
Hey, nice find, Patrick.
嘿，不错的发现，帕特里克。

06:42.777 --> 06:46.191
Cannon sit!
加农炮坐！

06:49.536 --> 06:51.674
Ah!
啊!

06:51.674 --> 06:54.605
Pool fight!
台球大战！

06:54.605 --> 06:56.087
- Pool fight!
- A pool fight!
- 台球大战！
- 台球大战！

06:56.087 --> 06:57.639
- Pool fight!
- Pool fight!
- 台球大战！
- 台球大战！

06:57.639 --> 07:00.950
A pool--
一个水池——

07:00.950 --> 07:04.777
Aw, it's broken.
噢，它坏了。

07:04.777 --> 07:06.915
Ride the wave!
乘风破浪！

07:06.915 --> 07:08.708
Ride the wave!
Yeah!
乘风破浪！
是的！

07:12.018 --> 07:14.570
- Tug it back.
- Tug it forth.
- 把它拉回来。
- 向前拉。

07:14.570 --> 07:16.743
- Tug it back.
- Tug it forth!
- 把它拉回来。
- 向前拉！

07:16.743 --> 07:18.708
- Ow!
- Oh!
- 噢！
- 哦！

07:32.950 --> 07:35.950
SpongeBob, watch this!
- Help me.
海绵宝宝，看这个！
- 帮我。

07:35.950 --> 07:38.984
Black hole!
黑洞！

07:38.984 --> 07:41.743
Wahoo!
哇呼！

07:46.881 --> 07:48.674
Again, again!
再一次，再一次！

08:00.398 --> 08:04.191
It's me!
I was the pool toy, you idiots!
这就是我！
我是泳池玩具，你们这些白痴！

08:05.501 --> 08:07.398
Squidward...
章鱼哥...

08:07.398 --> 08:10.329
that's the greatest magic trick
I've ever seen!
这是最伟大的魔术
我见过！

08:10.329 --> 08:13.294
Yeah, let's do it again!
是的，我们再来一次吧！

08:16.708 --> 08:19.294
Look, SpongeBob, I admit it.
听着，海绵宝宝，我承认。

08:19.294 --> 08:22.846
I used your pool
without permission
我用过你的泳池
未经许可

08:22.846 --> 08:26.191
because I'm really
jealous of it.
因为我真的
嫉妒它。

08:26.191 --> 08:29.605
I want your pool chairs. I
want your pool jets.
我想要你的泳池椅。我
想要你的泳池喷头。

08:29.605 --> 08:31.156
I want your pool noodles.
我想要你的泳池面条。

08:31.156 --> 08:35.743
And most of all,
I want this diving board.
最重要的是，
我想要这个跳水板。

08:38.260 --> 08:41.018
Squidward,
we're best neighbors.
章鱼哥，
我们是最好的邻居。

08:41.018 --> 08:43.812
You can use my pool
anytime you like,
你可以使用我的泳池
任何时候只要你愿意，

08:43.812 --> 08:45.777
day or night, you silly.
无论白天还是黑夜，你都傻了。

08:45.777 --> 08:50.122
Aw, gee, thanks SpongeBob.
噢，天哪，谢谢海绵宝宝。

08:50.122 --> 08:53.122
Say, how'd you like
to take a divey-wivey
说吧，你喜欢怎样
娶妻

08:53.122 --> 08:55.708
on the boardy-woardy, hmm?
在板凳上，嗯？

08:55.708 --> 08:59.329
Oh, no, thanks,
but I just couldn't.
哦，不，谢谢，
但我就是做不到。

08:59.329 --> 09:03.432
Please, you must take
a dive, Squidwardo.
拜托，你一定要带
潜水吧，章鱼哥。

09:03.432 --> 09:04.639
Huh?
啊？

09:04.639 --> 09:07.018
I would love to take a dive.
我很想去潜水。

09:07.018 --> 09:11.156
I was on my high school
swim team.
我当时在读高中
游泳队。

09:11.156 --> 09:14.501
Hey, Squidward,
this ladder is adjustable.
嘿，章鱼哥，
这个梯子是可以调节的。

09:14.501 --> 09:16.329
Do you want to go higher?
你想走得更高吗？

09:16.329 --> 09:18.777
I love you all too!
我也爱你们大家！

09:18.777 --> 09:20.984
Okay, I'll take that
as a yes.
好的，我会接受的
作为一个是。

09:20.984 --> 09:22.467
Crank it up, Patrick!
加把劲，帕特里克！

09:33.536 --> 09:36.294
<i>Ciao bella!</i>
I dive!
<i>再见贝拉！</i>
我潜水！

09:42.329 --> 09:47.156
<i>Troppo elevato!</i>
Too high, too high!
<i>Troppo 电梯！</i>
太高了，太高了！

09:47.156 --> 09:50.674
Oh, it's too high, Patrick.
Crank it down!
噢，太高了，帕特里克。
把它降下来！

09:50.674 --> 09:52.777
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

09:52.777 --> 09:54.225
Huh?
啊？

09:54.225 --> 09:57.605
What was that?
那是什么？

09:59.260 --> 10:03.915
Uh, uh... hmm.
呃，呃……嗯。

10:03.915 --> 10:06.122
Ah.
啊。

10:06.122 --> 10:08.639
Oh.
哦。

10:12.053 --> 10:14.605
Aw, hm.
Uh-huh?
噢，嗯。
嗯？

10:14.605 --> 10:17.536
Ah.
啊。

10:27.363 --> 10:29.467
- Yay!
- Yeah!
- 耶！
- 是的！

10:30.881 --> 10:33.018
Perfect dive, Squidward.
完美的潜水，章鱼哥。

10:34.087 --> 10:37.329
<i>And that's how I got here.</i>
<i>我就是这样来到这里的。</i>

10:41.398 --> 10:42.536
Typical.
典型的。

典型的。